    "media:imagetext": "Braniff flies the good times\nbetween Dallas/Fort Worth\nand LaGuardia\nDallas/Fort Worth to LaGuardia, 8:45 A.M., 12:15 Noon, 5:30 P.M.\n9:00 A.M., 2:15 P.M., 5:30 P.M\nLne good toes star rt ranite 8:45 a.m. nop-stop. is the most convenient early morning flight\nfrom Dallas/Fort Worth to LaGuardia, Manhattan's close-in airport. And at 5:30 p.m., you can\ntake advantage of our late-afternoon non-stop to LaGuardia after a full day's business. We give you good\ntimes back to Dallas/Fort Worth, too.\nPhone Braniff. We'll put you up in style to Kennedy or Newark airport if you prefer. We'll get you a con-\nfirmed reservation in five seconds. And arrange a room or rental car, too. It's all part of flying Branitf Style.\n12005.132.010.039",
